16
01:57:36,000 --> 01:57:42,000
Released in August 2015, the film received critical acclaim and was a
box office success, grossing $201.6 million worldwide.

17
02:04:57,000 --> 02:05:03,000
Straight Outta Compton earned several awards and nominations, including an Academy Award nomination for Best
Original Screenplay and a win for Outstanding Motion Picture at the 47th NAACP Image Awards.

18
02:12:18,000 --> 02:12:24,000
The film explores themes of drug dealer, police brutality,
husband wife relationship, rap music, hip-hop.

